Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.22,0:00:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前，在遥远的银河系…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:38.21,Title,0,0,0,0,,《星球大战》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.24,0:00:46.23,Title,0,0,0,0,,《前传：幽灵的威胁》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.25,0:00:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河共和国里动荡不安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.25,0:01:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为星际贸易通道上的税收问题纠纷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.26,0:01:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,贪婪的贸易联盟派出战斗舰队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.27,0:01:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,企图封锁一切运往纳布星系的货物
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.27,0:01:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,正当共和国会就这一连串危机争论不休的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.28,0:01:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,共和国首相已经秘密派出两名
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.28,0:01:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,维护和平和正义的绝地武士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.28,0:01:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,去解决冲突
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 船长 - 是，长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain. - Yes, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.69,0:02:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知他们我们要登舰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them we wish to board at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,满怀尊敬之意…\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.86,0:02:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,共和国首相的两位特使请求立即登舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}the ambassadors for the supreme chancellor wish to board immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.20,0:02:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.20,0:02:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如你所知，我们的封锁行动是合法的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you know, our blockade is perfectly legal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.41,0:02:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们欢迎共和国特使\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'd be happy to receive the ambassadors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.98,0:02:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是TC-14，欢迎两位，\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm TC-14 at your service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.73,0:02:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,请这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,特使的到访让我们倍感荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are greatly honoured by your visit, Ambassadors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.91,0:02:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,请稍候片刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make yourselves comfortable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.91,0:03:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的主人马上就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}My master will be with you shortly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一种不详的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a bad feeling about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我倒没感觉到 - 我不是说这次任务，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't sense anything. - It's not about the mission, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.67,0:03:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一种模糊的预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something elsewhere, elusive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.71,0:03:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你过于焦虑不安了，欧比旺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't centre on your anxieties, Obi-Wan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该把注意力放在这里，注意这里的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your concentration here and now, where it belongs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.47,0:03:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是尤达师父告诉我应该留意未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Master Yoda said I should be mindful of the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.43,0:03:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也不能不顾眼前的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not at the expense of the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要欣赏生命的原动力，年轻的绝地学徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be mindful of the living Force, young Padawan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.73,0:03:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,贸易总督会怎样回应首相的要求呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think this trade viceroy will deal with the chancellor's demands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.49,0:03:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,贸易联盟的人都是懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}These Federation types are cowards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.74,0:03:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈判会很快结束的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The negotiations will be short.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.45,0:03:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看这两位特使一定是绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ambassadors are Jedi knights, I believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.83,0:03:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来迫使我们答应条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here to force a settlement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住他们，我来联系西迪厄斯大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Distract them. I will contact Lord Sidious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.96,0:03:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you brain-dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.67,0:04:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不去见那两个绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going in there with two Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,派机器人去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send a droid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们等这么久是他们的习惯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it in their nature to make us wait this long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我察觉到一种不同寻常的恐惧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I sense an unusual amount of fear…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对解决贸易纠纷的谈判不太相干\N{\fnArial\fs30}for something as trivial as this trade dispute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.53,0:04:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的计划失败了，西迪厄斯大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This scheme of yours has failed, Lord Sidious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.33,0:04:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,封锁结束了，我们不敢对抗绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blockade is finished. We dare not go against these Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.00,0:04:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督，别叫这胆小鬼再出现我眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viceroy, I don't want this stunted slime in my sight again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.17,0:04:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸事情出现变化，要速战速决\N{\fnArial\fs30}This turn of events is unfortunate. We must accelerate our plans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.34,0:04:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你的军队开始登陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begin landing your troops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.01,0:04:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,大人，那样做合法吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord, is that legal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让它合法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will make it legal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地武士怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Jedi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:05:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相根本不应派他们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chancellor should never have brought them into this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.31,0:05:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即干掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.19,0:05:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，大人，一定照办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my lord. As you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长，看！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.28,0:05:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动防护罩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shields…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.16,0:05:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.79,0:05:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是毒气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dioxis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.55,0:05:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们应该已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be dead by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,若未死的话，干掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy what's left of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.56,0:05:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查看一下，下士，我会掩护你的 - 收到，收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check it out, Corporal. We'll cover you. - Roger, roger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.48,0:05:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blast them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.90,0:05:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面出什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is going on down there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.57,0:05:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,通讯中断了，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost the transmission, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经和绝地武士交过手吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever encountered a Jedi knight before, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.17,0:06:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有，封闭舰桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no, but I don't… Seal off the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.25,0:06:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是，长官 - 那样阻止不了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - That won't be enough, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.09,0:06:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上派机器人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want droidekas up here at once!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下我们可要完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not survive this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.27,0:06:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭闸门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the blast doors!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下他们进不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will hold them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.95,0:06:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看他们仍可穿过\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are still coming through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.79,0:06:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么可能！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is impossible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.21,0:06:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的机器人怎么还不来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are those droidekas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.64,0:07:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父！小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master! Destroyers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.81,0:07:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有防护罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have shield generators!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个平局，我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a standoff. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.53,0:07:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们挡不住机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're no match for droidekas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.15,0:07:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.95,0:07:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们进入了通风气道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've gone up the ventilation shaft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 战斗机器人 - 这是一支入侵部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Battle droids. - It's an invasion army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.84,0:07:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是贸易联盟的诡计\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an odd play for the Trade Federation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.63,0:07:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得警告纳布星球并联系维罗伦首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to warn the Naboo and contact Chancellor Valorum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分头行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's split up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.51,0:07:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏在不同的战舰里，着陆之后再会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stow aboard separate ships and meet down on the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.85,0:07:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一件事你说对了，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right about one thing, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.64,0:07:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈判的确结束得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}The negotiations were short.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.48,0:07:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，星球上有通讯来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, a transmission from the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是阿米达拉女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Queen Amidala herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于有结果了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last we are getting results.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.03,0:08:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又见到面了，女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again you come before us, Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.16,0:08:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在别高兴得太早\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not be so pleased when you hear what I have to say, Viceroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.37,0:08:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的贸易封锁行动已经失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your trade boycott of our planet has ended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.20,0:08:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我怎么不知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was not aware of such failure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道两位特使在你们那儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have word that the chancellor's ambassadors are with you now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,要求你们马上达成协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that you have been commanded to reach settlement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.54,0:08:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听说过什么特使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know nothing of any ambassadors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是搞错了，陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.43,0:08:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道，总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beware, Viceroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.55,0:08:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,联盟这次做得太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Federation has gone too far this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.39,0:08:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有国会的同意我们是不敢乱来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would never do anything without the approval of the senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.56,0:08:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是太多心了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You assume too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.19,0:08:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.19,0:08:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她说的对，国会绝对不会… - 现在说这个太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's right. The senate will never… - It's too late now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她怀疑我们要进攻吗？ - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you think she suspects an attack? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是必须马上切断所有同纳布星的通讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we must move quickly to disrupt all communications down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.25,0:09:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说共和国首相的两位特使不在那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negotiations haven 't started because the ambassadors aren't there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.13,0:09:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么可能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could that be true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从首相那里得到消息是：特使们已经到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have assurances from the chancellor his ambassadors did arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是…谈判…特使们…后果…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must… handiwork… negotiate… ambassadors…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有人可以… - 帕尔帕庭议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- nobody would… - Senator Palpatine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.51,0:09:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查一下通讯发射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the transmission generator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.52,0:09:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,通讯中断表明贸易联盟已经…入侵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A communications disruption can mean only one thing: invasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.48,0:09:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,联盟现在还不敢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Federation would not dare go that far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,国会有权撤消他贸易的特权，那样他们就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The senate would revoke their trade franchise, and they'd be finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须继续进行谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must continue to rely on negotiation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.78,0:09:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈判？ 通讯完全中断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negotiation? We've lost all communications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.12,0:09:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不知道特使在什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where are the chancellor's ambassadors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.79,0:09:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况非常危险，女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a dangerous situation, Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的保安志愿军兵力有限…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our security volunteers will be no match…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵挡不住贸易联盟的庞大军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}against a battle-hardened Federation army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.30,0:09:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不允许任何导致战争的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not condone a course of action that will lead us to war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 遵命，总督？ - 我们搜查了整个战舰…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, Viceroy? - Captain, we've searched the ship…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.67,0:10:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有发现绝地武士的踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there is no trace of the Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也许藏在那艘登陆艇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They may have gotten on one of your landing craft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.80,0:10:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们真的在这我们会找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they're down here, sir, we'll find them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,多加小心，不要低估了这两个绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use caution. These Jedi are not to be underestimated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.53,0:11:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦，不！ - 走开！离开这儿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no! - Get away! Get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.16,0:11:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么东西？等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was'n dat? Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.96,0:11:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, mooie-mooie, I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.84,0:11:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点送了我们的命，你没脑筋吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You almost got us killed. Are you brainless?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.01,0:11:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会说话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.76,0:11:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,会说话不证明你就有头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ability to speak does not make you intelligent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.01,0:11:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了，快走吧 - 不，不，我得留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, get out of here. - No, no, mesa stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.01,0:11:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫加加宾可斯，你卑微的仆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa culled JarJar Binks. Mesa your humble servant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.18,0:11:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不需要仆人 - 你得需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That won't be necessary. - Oh, but it'tis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.39,0:11:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是神的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Tis demanded by the gods, it'tis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.39,0:11:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦，不！ - 快趴下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no! - Stay down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.65,0:11:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又救了我一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.53,0:11:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是谁？ - 一个当地人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's this? - A local.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.53,0:11:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会有机械人来的，快走，还有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here before more droids show up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.20,0:11:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有？你是说还有机械人要来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}More? "More" did you spake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.71,0:12:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，但最安全的地方是冈根城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ex-squeeze-me, but de mostest safest place would be Gunga City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.71,0:12:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在那里长大的，那城市很隐蔽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is where I grew up. 'Tis a hidden city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.55,0:12:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 城市？ - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A city? - Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.55,0:12:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来带我们去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you take us there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.89,0:12:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…那可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}On second thought, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.81,0:12:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能带你们去 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not really, no. - No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.43,0:12:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起来不好意思…\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Tis embarrassing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.68,0:12:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是被流放出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my afraid my've been banished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.77,0:12:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才忘了，首领不会轻饶了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My forgotten. Da bosses would do terrible tings to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是回去了就饶不了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrible tings to me if me goen back dare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.15,0:12:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听到了吗？ - 听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You hear that? - Yah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么大批的机器人朝着这个方向杀来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the sound of a thousand terrible things heading this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.16,0:12:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果让他们发现了，我们可就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they find us, they will crush us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.87,0:12:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,粉身粹骨了，到时候我们连渣都没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}grind us into tiny pieces and blast us into oblivion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.37,0:12:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的一点不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yousa point is well seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.59,0:12:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走，快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dis way. Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.22,0:12:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有多远？ - 下面的路我们得从水下走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much further? - Wesa goen underwater, okeyday?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, my warning you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.64,0:13:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,冈根人不喜欢外来人，别希望他们会欢迎你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gungans no liken outsiders, so don't spect a warm welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.89,0:13:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系，今天不光是他们不欢迎我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. This hasn't been our day for warm welcomes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.66,0:13:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，你们跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yousa follow me now, okeyday?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.37,0:14:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家的感觉真好啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}So good bein home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.54,0:14:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是加加 - 他还敢回来呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, me gusa. - Hata-hata.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.68,0:14:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们几个都站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, yousa. Stopa dare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.39,0:14:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，塔布斯队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heyo-dales, Cap'n Tarpals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.85,0:14:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还敢回来，加加，去见首领嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah gain, JarJar. Yousa goen tada bosses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.89,0:14:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次你的麻烦可大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yousa in big dudu dis time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真粗鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}How wude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yousa cannot bees hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.08,0:15:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些机械人部队是你们招惹来的，我说的没错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dis army of Mackineeks up dare is new weesong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些机械人部队马上就要进攻纳布城了 我们必须通知他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}A droid army is about to attack the Naboo. We must warn them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不喜欢纳布城的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wesa no like da Naboo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.47,0:15:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们自以为自己聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Da Naboo tink day so smarty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,总觉得自己的脑子比我们的好用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day tink day brains so big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.43,0:15:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,机械人一旦控制了纳布城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once those droids take control of the surface, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就会控制了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will take control of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,.我觉得不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa no tink so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.11,0:15:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就不知道我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day not know of uss-en.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.11,0:15:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们和纳布人是共生关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and the Naboo form a symbiont circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.15,0:15:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一方所受的灾难会影响另一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens to one of you will affect the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.34,0:15:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must understand this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.66,0:15:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳布人是死是活跟我没有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wesa no carrrre-nn about da Naboo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就赶快让我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then speed us on our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要滚，那就快滚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wesa ganna speed yous away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.87,0:15:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在我们缺少交通工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could use a transport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.79,0:15:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会给你们一艘邦高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wesa give yousa una bongo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,到纳布城最快的途径\N{\fnArial\fs30}Da speediest way tooda Naboo…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.97,0:15:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是从行星的地心穿过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}'tis goen through the planet core.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:15:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.81,0:16:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.73,0:16:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你的帮助，我们会和平的离去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your help. We leave in peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父，邦高是什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master, what's a bongo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.27,0:16:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿是一座飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}A transport, I hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.36,0:16:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是在耍你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deysa setten yousa up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.57,0:16:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,从地心穿过去？那是会要人命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goen through da planet core? Bad bombin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,学雷锋做好事嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any help here would be hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父，我们时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master, we're short on time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一位领航员才能穿过地心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll need a navigator to get us through the planet's core.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个冈根人也许能帮助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Gungan may be of help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.67,0:16:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能告诉我们，你们要把加加怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is to become of JarJar Binks here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.84,0:16:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,严厉惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hisen to be pune-ished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.68,0:16:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救过他的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他也欠我一条命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He owes me what you call a "life-debt."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.81,0:16:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,依你们神的旨意，他的命应该是属于我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your gods demand that his life belongs to me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.77,0:16:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,宾可斯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Binks…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.23,0:16:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的欠他一条命吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}yousa havena liveplay with thisen hisen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.25,0:16:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.95,0:17:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你跟他去吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begone wit him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.45,0:17:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不要跟你去了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Count me outta dis one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.95,0:17:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁可死在这也不愿死在地心里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better dead here than dead in da core.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.21,0:17:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪！我在说些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yee gods! What mesa sayin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.56,0:17:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是疯了，是恐怖鱼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dis is nutsen. Oh, gooberfish!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.48,0:17:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么被流放了，加加？ - 说来话长了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why were you banished, JarJar? - It's a longo tale-o…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.86,0:17:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,归根到底应该是… 我太笨了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}buta a small part of it would be mesa… clumsy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.03,0:17:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为笨就把你流放吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were banished for being clumsy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.43,0:17:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yousa might'n be sayin dat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.75,0:18:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这个人太粗心，以前出过一两个小事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa caused mabee one two-y lettle bitty axadentes, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.09,0:18:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆掉一个油库…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yud-say boom da gasser…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.26,0:18:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不小心把首领的船撞烂了，就被流放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}den crashin der boss's heyblibber, den banished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.31,0:18:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大恐怖鱼！好大的牙齿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big gooberfish! Huge-o teeth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.20,0:18:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是大鱼吃小鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always a bigger fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.22,0:18:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为咱们还是回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa tink we goen back now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.63,0:18:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵行动按时进行，大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The invasion is on schedule, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.97,0:18:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直拖延了国会的议程\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the senate bogged down in procedures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.09,0:18:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们别无选择，只有接受你对纳布城的控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will have no choice but to accept your control of the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.64,0:19:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是艾米达拉女王坚持，国会会站在她那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}The queen has great faith that the senate will side with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.48,0:19:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那位阿米达拉女王年轻又幼稚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen Amidala is young and naive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.56,0:19:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制着她不会是一件困难的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will find controlling her will not be difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.15,0:19:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.49,0:19:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没跟他提那两个失踪的绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell him about the missing Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.49,0:19:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要向他报告，直到我们需要报告再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need to report that to him until we have something to report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们这要去哪儿？ - 别担心，原力会指引我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where wesa goin? - Don't worry. The Force will guide us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，好厉害的原力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, maxi big, da Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.04,0:19:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不相信什么原力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, dat smells stinkowiff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.42,0:19:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 失去动力了 - 哦，不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're losing power. - Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.77,0:19:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wesa dyin' here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.14,0:19:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别紧张，情况没那么严重 - 还没什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just relax. We're not in trouble yet. - What "yet"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.94,0:19:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面是怪物，船又漏水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters out dare. Leak'n in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.02,0:19:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快要沉了又没有动力？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All sink'n and no power?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,都这样了还不算严重吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whena yousa tinkin wesa in trouble?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.28,0:19:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,动力恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power's back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.70,0:20:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物回来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monster's back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.50,0:20:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把它吓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You overdid it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.16,0:20:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.73,0:20:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head for that outcropping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.89,0:20:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督，我们抓到女王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viceroy, we have captured the queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.35,0:21:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈，胜利了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.53,0:21:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真漂亮呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dis'n loverly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.87,0:21:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对此你怎么向国会作出解释？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will you explain this invasion to the senate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.33,0:21:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要女王和我签署一个协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}The queen and I will sign a treaty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.42,0:21:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,使我们在这里的行动合法化\N{\fnArial\fs30}that will legitimize our occupation here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.63,0:21:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信国会一定会同意我这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have assurances it will be ratified by the senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是不会合作的 - 行了，女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will not cooperate. - Now, now, Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.51,0:21:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那时，你人民蒙受苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}In time, your people's suffering{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.57,0:21:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将会劝说你答应我们的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}will persuade you to see our point of view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.97,0:21:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 指挥官 - 是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Commander. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.01,0:21:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Process them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.77,0:22:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉，把他们关到四号监狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, take them to Camp 4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.69,0:22:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到，收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, roger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.20,0:22:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开街道，女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should leave the street, Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.53,0:23:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿他们的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get their weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.99,0:23:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真够棒的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yousa guys bombad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.87,0:23:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是最高议会的特使\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ambassadors for the supreme chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.38,0:23:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你们的谈判失败了，先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your negotiations seemed to have failed, Ambassador.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.38,0:23:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有开始谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}The negotiations never took place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.34,0:23:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须和共和国取得联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's urgent that we make contact with the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.84,0:23:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,通讯全都被他们切断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've knocked out all our communications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.05,0:23:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们有飞船吗？ - 总机库里有，那边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have transports? - In the main hangar. This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.35,0:23:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们人太多了 - 别担心，没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There are too many of them. - That won't be a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.56,0:23:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下，在这种情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Highness, under the circumstances, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.33,0:23:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议请你跟我们到科罗斯肯特星球去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you come to Coruscant with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.23,0:23:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢特使先生，我要和我的人民在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Ambassador, but my place is with my people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.40,0:23:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们会杀死你的 - 他们不敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They will kill you if you stay. - They wouldn't dare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.24,0:23:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要女王签署入侵合法化\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need her to sign a treaty to make this invasion legal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.41,0:23:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以不会杀死她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't afford to kill her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.07,0:23:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看他们在背后另有阴谋，女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something else behind all this, Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.33,0:23:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看他们另有阴谋，入侵行动不合逻辑\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no logic in the Federation's move here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.41,0:23:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们是要除掉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My feelings tell me they will destroy you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.50,0:23:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能期盼国会站在我们一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our only hope is for the senate to side with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.00,0:23:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕尔帕庭议员会需要你们的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator Palpatine will need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.59,0:23:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样，我们的处境都很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either choice presents great danger… to us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.67,0:24:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会勇敢，女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are brave, Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.67,0:24:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要走，女王陛下，现在就得走\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are to leave, Your Highness, it must be now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.05,0:24:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会向国会请求的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I will plead our case to the senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.55,0:24:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,多加小心，总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful, Governor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.27,0:24:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得拯救那些飞行员\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll need to free those pilots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.61,0:24:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll deal with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.95,0:24:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.12,0:24:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是首相的特使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ambassador to the supreme chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.91,0:24:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在和这些科罗斯肯特人交谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking these people to Coruscant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.62,0:24:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们要去哪？ - 去科罗斯肯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you taking them? - To Coruscant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.96,0:24:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,科罗斯肯特？这名字无法验测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coruscant? Uh, that doesn't compute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.71,0:24:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，等等，你们被捕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, wait. Uh, you're under arrest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.09,0:24:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.68,0:24:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.20,0:25:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就待在这儿，不要惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, stay here and keep out of trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.29,0:25:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好啊，夥计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boyos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.80,0:25:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是联盟的战舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the blockade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.86,0:25:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,防护罩起动器被击中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shield generator's been hit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.99,0:25:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真粗鲁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}How wude!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.58,0:26:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的机械人损失惨重\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're losing droids fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.00,0:26:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有防护罩，我们就成了活靶子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can't get the shield generator fixed, we'll be sitting ducks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.80,0:26:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,防护罩没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shields are gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.18,0:26:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在恢复了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power's back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.31,0:26:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小机器人修复了主动力引擎，\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little droid did it. He bypassed the main power drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.90,0:26:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,防护罩调到最大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deflector shields up at maximum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.08,0:26:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到不了科罗斯肯特了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not enough power to get us to Coruscant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.50,0:26:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,超光速引擎在漏油\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hyperdrive is leaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.91,0:26:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先找个地方着陆，修补飞船再加防护\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to land somewhere to refuel and repair the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.92,0:26:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿，师父，塔图因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, Master. Tatooine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.21,0:26:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里离航道非常远\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's small, out of the way, poor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.00,0:26:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太可能有贸易联盟的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Trade Federation have no presence there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.88,0:26:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这样肯定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you be sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.88,0:27:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是赫特人的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's controlled by the Hutts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.93,0:27:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿你不能抓他们的女王殿下 赫特人都是匪徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't take Her Royal Highness there. The Hutts are gangsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.85,0:27:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果他们发现她… - 那跟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If they discovered her… - It'd be no different than landing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.26,0:27:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在贸易联盟控制的星球没什么两样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a system controlled by the Federation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.27,0:27:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非赫特人没想要抓她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}except that the Hutts aren't looking for her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.48,0:27:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样给我们优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}which gives us the advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.03,0:27:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿米达拉女王在协议上签字了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Queen Amidala, has she signed the treaty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.15,0:27:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她逃跑了，大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has disappeared, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.91,0:27:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说纳布星的飞船通过我们的封锁线？\N{\fnArial\fs30}One Naboo cruiser got past the blockade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.74,0:27:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要她签协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that treaty signed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.25,0:27:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.41,0:27:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我们现在找不到那些飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's impossible to locate the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.08,0:27:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它飞出了我们的探侧范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's out of our range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.42,0:27:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,西斯人可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for a Sith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.26,0:27:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的徒弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my apprentice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.26,0:27:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,达斯·摩尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darth Maul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.51,0:27:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会帮助你找那艘飞船的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will find your lost ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.14,0:27:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在更麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is getting out of hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.56,0:27:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了一个君主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there are two of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.73,0:28:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不听他的就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should not have made this bargain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.03,0:28:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏了这个精巧的机器人，女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}An extremely well-put-together little droid, Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.70,0:28:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,它救了飞船，也救了我们大家的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without a doubt, it saved the ship, as well as our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.70,0:28:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要奖赏他，他的号码是多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is to be commended. What is its number?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.71,0:28:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是R2D2，女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2-D2, Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.96,0:28:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，R2D2\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, R2-D2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.17,0:28:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕德梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Padme{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.13,0:28:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好给他清洗一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean this droid up as best you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.39,0:28:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该感谢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It deserves our gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.14,0:28:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着说吧，船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Continue, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.64,0:28:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下，请允许…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Highness, with your permission…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.60,0:28:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在正飞往一个叫塔普尼的遥远的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're heading for a remote planet called Tatooine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.48,0:28:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是贸易联盟势力之外的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in a system far beyond the reach of the Trade Federation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.94,0:28:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不同意到那个星球去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not agree with the Jedi on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.65,0:28:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,请相信我的判断，女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must trust my judgment, Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.99,0:28:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.83,0:29:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，能问问你是谁吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Husa are yousa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.96,0:29:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫帕德梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Padme{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.50,0:29:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫加加宾可斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa JarJar Binks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.34,0:29:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是冈根人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a Gungan, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.93,0:29:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你怎么跑到这儿来了？ - 我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd you end up here with us? - My no know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.64,0:29:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早晨，我正高高兴兴的吃早饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa day starten pitty okeyday witda brisky morning munchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.43,0:29:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然，砰的一声吓坏我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Den boom! Getten berry scared…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.35,0:29:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个绝地武士就救了我一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and grabben dat Jedi, and pow… mesa here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.02,0:29:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？我非常非常害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa getten berry, berry scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.82,0:29:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就是… 塔图因星球 - 那是一个市镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it… Tatooine. - There's a settlement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.03,0:29:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,着陆时离市镇远一点，不要引起人们的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Land near the outskirts. We don't want to attract attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.39,0:30:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,超光速已经失灵了，得换个新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hyperdrive generator's gone, Master. We'll need a new one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.31,0:30:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况很棘手，要小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll complicate things. Be wary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.89,0:30:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我感到原力受到干扰了 - 我也感觉到了，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I sense a disturbance in the Force. - I feel it also, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.15,0:30:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,要他们别再传输信息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let them send any transmissions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.28,0:30:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，这太阳真的是　死人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sun doen murder to mesa skin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.82,0:30:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.41,0:30:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.24,0:30:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下命令你们带上她的女仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her Highness commands you to take her handmaiden with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.25,0:30:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王今天就别再发布命令了，船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more commands from Her Highness today, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.13,0:30:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个太空站很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spaceport is not going to be pleasant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.34,0:30:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是女王的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}The queen wishes it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.59,0:30:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对这个星球很好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's curious about the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.09,0:30:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真拿她没办法 不要离我太远\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a good idea. Stay close to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.94,0:31:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,湿气农场，是主要部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moisture farms, for the most part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.07,0:31:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,住的一些本土部落和一些外来定居的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some indigenous tribes and scavengers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.91,0:31:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这种偏远的太空站…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The few spaceports like this one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.91,0:31:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那些不希望被找到人的天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}are havens for those that don't wish to be found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.33,0:31:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.58,0:31:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太糟糕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dissen berry, berry bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.75,0:31:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这什么破路啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Icky, icky goo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.47,0:31:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,去一家小一点的店\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll try one of the smaller dealers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.61,0:31:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.15,0:31:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,想买点什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.65,0:31:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有J型327雷比亚飞船的零件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need parts for a J-type 327 Nubian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.86,0:31:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有，雷比亚！有的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes! Nubian. We have lots of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.66,0:31:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子，起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, get in here now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.66,0:32:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的机械人有我所需要的零件清单\N{\fnArial\fs30}My droid has a readout of what I need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.17,0:32:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么耽搁这么久啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What took you so long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.67,0:32:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在擦风扇的开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was cleaning the fan switches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.17,0:32:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着铺子，我有笔生意要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the store. I've got some selling to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.05,0:32:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生，咱们到后面去吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, let me take thee out back, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.43,0:32:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿有你需要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find what you need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.81,0:32:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也不要碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.86,0:32:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是个天使吗？ - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you an angel? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.86,0:32:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使，我听外太空飞行员说起过天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}An angel. I heard the deep space pilots talk about them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.70,0:32:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是宇宙中最漂亮的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the most beautiful creatures in the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.70,0:32:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们住在伊国月球上，我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They live on the moons of Iego, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.08,0:32:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个孩子真有意思 你怎么知道那么多？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a funny little boy. How do you know so much?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.87,0:32:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是听路过这的商贩和星际飞行员说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I listen to all the traders and star pilots who come through here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.84,0:32:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是飞行员，你知道吗，总有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a pilot, you know, and someday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.99,0:32:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会飞出这个地方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna fly away from this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.26,0:32:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是飞行员？ - 当了一辈子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're a pilot? - Mm-hmm. All my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.34,0:33:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这里多久了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you been here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.76,0:33:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,小时候就来了，大概三岁吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since I was very little. Three, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.89,0:33:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我妈妈被卖给赫特人歌杜拿，\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom and I were sold to Gardulla the Hutt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.73,0:33:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在飞行比赛中他把我们输给了别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she lost us betting on the Podraces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.56,0:33:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是奴隶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a slave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.48,0:33:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是个人，我的名字是安纳金 - 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm a person, and my name is Anakin. - I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.74,0:33:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不太明白，这个地方对我来说太奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't fully understand. This is a strange place to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.94,0:33:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where… Wheres yousa goin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.92,0:33:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got ya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.59,0:33:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？敲它的鼻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit the nose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.01,0:33:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要的是T-14超光速引擎，你真走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}A T-14 hyperdrive generator. Thee in luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.68,0:33:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西只有我这里有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the only one hereabouts who has one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.43,0:33:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你还是买艘新飞船那样更合算\N{\fnArial\fs30}But thee might as well buy a new ship. It would be cheaper, I think, huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.60,0:33:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying of which…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.10,0:33:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎样付款呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how's thee gonna pay for all this, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.61,0:33:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有两万的共和国信用额\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have 20, 000 Republic dataries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.78,0:34:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,共和国信用？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Republic credits?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.74,0:34:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,共和国的信贷在这里不通用，我要比较实在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Republic credits are no good out here. I need something more real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.78,0:34:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有其它东西了，但信用是可用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have anything else, but credits will do fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.03,0:34:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不，那不行 - 信用可用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, they won't. - Credits will do fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.79,0:34:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，信用不行！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they won't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.75,0:34:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你是绝地武士吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think you're some kind of Jedi, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.83,0:34:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像这样子挥挥手吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}waving your hand around like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.04,0:34:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是陶达人，心灵控制对我无效，我要现金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a Toydarian. Mind tricks don't work on me. Only money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.13,0:34:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没钱，就没零件，没交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}No money, no parts, no deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.63,0:34:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可告诉你这没有人有P-14引擎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no one else has a T-14 hyperdrive, I promise you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.06,0:34:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能够生存这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't have lasted long anyways{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.19,0:34:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我精于手艺\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I wasn't so good at building things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.07,0:34:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧，加加\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're leaving. JarJar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.57,0:34:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识你很高兴，安纳金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad to have met you, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.24,0:34:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识你我也很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was glad to meet you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.76,0:35:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，哪儿去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Wha… Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.46,0:35:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,外来人，他们以为我们什么都不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outlanders. They think we know nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.13,0:35:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对我挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They seemed nice to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.18,0:35:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,清洗货架，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean the racks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.22,0:35:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you can go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.68,0:35:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yippee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.52,0:35:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞船上有没有贵重物品？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're sure there 's nothing left on board?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.02,0:35:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞船上有些食粮补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few containers of supplies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.02,0:35:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王的外衣也许值钱，但肯定不够交易…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The queen's ward robe, maybe, but not enough for you to barter with…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.19,0:35:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个引擎所需的金额数量\N{\fnArial\fs30}not in the amount you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.65,0:35:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，没关系，我相信一定会有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm sure another solution will present itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.70,0:35:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一会再跟你联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check back later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.87,0:35:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能去，不能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah gain. Noah gain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.66,0:35:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的人都是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Da beings hereabouts, cawazy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.62,0:35:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会抢劫我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wesa be wobbed un crunched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.21,0:35:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的，我们没有什么值钱的东西，这就是我们的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not likely. We have nothing of value. That's our problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.64,0:36:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算要付钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to pay for that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.06,0:36:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他值7个乌比奥（货币）\N{\fnArial\fs30}It costs seven wupiupi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.23,0:36:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.07,0:36:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.08,0:36:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, mesa…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.00,0:36:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心呀，泽布巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, Sebulba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.25,0:36:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是个厉害的外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a big-time outlander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.38,0:36:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在比赛之前我可不想见到你送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd hate to see you diced before we race again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.05,0:36:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一次我们比赛的时候，小子，你就要完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time we race, boy, it will be the end of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.05,0:36:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不是个奴隶，我早就宰了你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you weren't a slave, I'd squash you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.80,0:36:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，那么遗憾的是你就得为我的命赔钱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it'd be a pity if you had to pay for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.77,0:36:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hi there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.02,0:36:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友差点变成了烂桔子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your buddy here was about to be turned into orange goo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.94,0:36:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他挑起了一场争斗，和一个德格人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He picked a fight with a Dug…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.94,0:36:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个特别危险的德格人，叫泽布巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}an especially dangerous Dug called Sebulba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.57,0:37:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢打架，能不打还是不打的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa haten crunchen. Das da las ting mesa want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.28,0:37:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然这样，这小子是对的，你没少惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nevertheless, the boy is right. You were heading into trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.83,0:37:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，我的小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, my young friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.00,0:37:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是… 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.18,0:37:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我没做什么错事啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}But mesa doen nutten!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.96,0:37:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙暴会减慢他们的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}This storm will slow them down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.67,0:37:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks pretty bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.51,0:37:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事？ - 收到总部的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Panaka. - Receiving a message from home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.14,0:37:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会等着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.35,0:37:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你，你会喜欢这些水果的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, you'll like these pallies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.65,0:37:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.40,0:37:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，我的骨头又疼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bones are aching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.82,0:37:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙暴马上就要来了，快点回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm's coming up, Ani. You better get home quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.49,0:37:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们有防风的地方吗？ - 我们回飞船去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have shelter? - We'll head back to our ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.45,0:37:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 远不远？ - 在市镇外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it far? - It's on the outskirts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.16,0:37:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没时间赶回飞船了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never reach the outskirts in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.67,0:38:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙风暴要来了，是非常非常危险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandstorms are very, very dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.67,0:38:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，我带你们去我们家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I'll take you to my place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.85,0:38:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.19,0:38:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈，我回来了！ - 噢，这真舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom, I'm home! - Ah, dissen cosy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.02,0:38:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是我的朋友，妈妈 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These are my friends, Mom. - Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.52,0:38:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫奎刚·金 - 我正在制造一个机器人，要看看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Qui-Gon Jinn. - I'm building a droid. You wanna see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.19,0:38:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你儿子让我们来这儿躲避沙暴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son was kind enough to offer us shelter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.70,0:38:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀，看看我的3PO\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I'll show you 3PO.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.46,0:38:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样，不错吧？我还没做完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't he great? He's not finished yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.84,0:38:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.38,0:38:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的喜欢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really like him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.22,0:38:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是公关机器人，能帮助妈妈，你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a protocol droid to help Mom. Watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.56,0:38:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,人都哪儿去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is everybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.97,0:39:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.35,0:39:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.65,0:39:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，我是C-3PO，公关机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am C-3PO, human cyborg relations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.07,0:39:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意为你效劳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How might I serve you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.07,0:39:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他太完美了 - 完美？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's perfect. - Oh. Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.99,0:39:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,等沙暴过去了，我带你去看看我的赛艇，是我制作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the storm is over, I'll show you my racer. I'm building a Podracer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.91,0:39:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方好像有些不平\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure this floor is entirely stable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.58,0:39:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好， 我们好像没有见过面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. I don't believe we have been introduced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.71,0:39:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2-D2，很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2-D2. A pleasure to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.09,0:39:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是C-3PO，公关机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am C-3PO, human cyborg relations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.76,0:39:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，你说「赤裸」？「赤裸」是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg your pardon, but what do you mean, "naked"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.64,0:39:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的内部零件裸露？ 我的上帝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parts are showing? My goodness!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.52,0:39:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳布星的人民死伤惨重\N{\fnArial\fs30}The death toll is catastrophic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.10,0:39:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是让步吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must bow to their wishes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.61,0:39:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须和我联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must contact me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.77,0:39:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个圈套，不要回覆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a trick. Send no reply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.57,0:39:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么信息也不要发过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send no transmissions of any kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.87,0:40:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想利用通讯信号来确定我们的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like bait to establish a connection trace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.87,0:40:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是真的呢？ 真的死伤惨重呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it is true, and the people are dying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.96,0:40:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, we're running out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.05,0:40:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔普尼是人口稀疏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tatooine is sparsely populated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.30,0:40:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果位置正确，定能找到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the trace was correct, I will find them quickly, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.22,0:40:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,先对付绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move against the Jedi first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.23,0:40:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候你就轻而易举地把女王带到纳布星来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will then have no difficulty in taking the queen to Naboo…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.06,0:40:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,签署协议了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to sign the treaty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.07,0:40:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们终于可以向绝地武士显露身份了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last we will reveal ourselves to the Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.36,0:40:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以有机会报仇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last we will have revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.90,0:40:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经训练有素了，我的小徒弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been well-trained, my young apprentice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.91,0:40:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是你的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will be no match for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.16,0:40:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在每一个奴隶的体内都安装了一个发射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}All slaves have a transmitter placed inside their bodies somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.25,0:41:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想做一个扫描器把我的发射器找出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been working on a scanner to try and locate mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.38,0:41:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要是逃跑的话… - 就会被发射器炸死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any attempt to escape… - And they blow you up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.80,0:41:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,太没礼貌了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}How wude!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.51,0:41:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没想到银河系还有奴隶制\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe there's still slavery in the galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.05,0:41:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,共和国有反奴隶法啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Republic's antislavery laws…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.06,0:41:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,共和国管不到我们这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Republic doesn't exist out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.52,0:41:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要生存就得靠自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must survive on our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.69,0:41:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Xcuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.27,0:41:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有谁看过飞艇赛吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anybody ever seen a Podrace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.94,0:41:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,马拉斯代尔星球有飞艇赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have Podracing on Malastare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.86,0:41:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度很快，非常危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very fast, very dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.36,0:41:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是唯一能开的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the only human who can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.37,0:41:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你得有绝地武士的反应速度才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have Jedi reflexes if you race pods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.49,0:41:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.33,0:41:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个绝地武士，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a Jedi knight, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.88,0:41:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道的？ - 我看见你的激光剑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What makes you think that? - I saw your laser sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.88,0:41:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有绝地武士才有这种武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only Jedis carry that kind of weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.89,0:41:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也许我是杀了绝地武士缴获的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I killed a Jedi and took it from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.14,0:41:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.89,0:42:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人能杀得了绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can kill a Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.89,0:42:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿你说的是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish that were so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.06,0:42:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一次我梦见我自己成了绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a dream I was a Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.23,0:42:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来解放所有的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came back here and freed all the slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.52,0:42:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们是来解放我们的吗？ - 不，很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you come to free us? - No, I'm afraid not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.99,0:42:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你们是 要不然你们来这儿干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you have. Why else would you be here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.20,0:42:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不想欺骗你啊，安纳金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see there's no fooling you, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.08,0:42:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是要到银河系的首府\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on our way to Coruscant, the central system in the Republic…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.21,0:42:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,科斯肯特去执行一项重要任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a very important mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.34,0:42:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们怎么跑到银河系的外围来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you end up out here in the outer rim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.50,0:42:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的飞船坏了，这里好修理飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our ship was damaged, and we're stranded here until we can repair it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.39,0:42:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你们，我什么都会修\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help. I can fix anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.72,0:42:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.35,0:42:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我们得需要搞到所需要的零件\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first we must acquire the parts we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.27,0:42:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们又没钱去买\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wit no-nutten mula to trade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.10,0:42:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些小商贩一定有某些弱点，我们可以利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}These junk dealers must have a weakness of some kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.77,0:42:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌博，他们为了赛艇比赛什么东西都愿意赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gambling. Everything here revolves around betting on those awful races.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.19,0:42:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞梭赛车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Podracing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.57,0:43:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以利用他们的贪心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greed can be a powerful ally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.61,0:43:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我造的飞艇是速度最快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I built a racer. It's the fastest ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.62,0:43:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天嘣嗒前夕有场大赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a big race tomorrow on Boonta Eve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.04,0:43:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们帮我报名吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could enter my pod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.96,0:43:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金，瓦图不会同意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin, Watto won't let you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.48,0:43:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦图不知道我造了赛艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watto doesn't know I've built it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.13,0:43:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说是你们的赛艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could make him think it was yours…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.13,0:43:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,想办法让他们允许我开就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get him to let me pilot it for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.46,0:43:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让你去，那太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you to race. It's awful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.17,0:43:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次瓦图让你比赛都让我担心死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I die every time Watto makes you do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.80,0:43:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是妈妈，我非常喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Mom, I love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.05,0:43:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说赢了奖金还可以帮他们买零件\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prize money would more than pay for the parts they need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.73,0:43:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.14,0:43:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.02,0:43:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁对共和国比较友好可以帮助我们的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anyone friendly to the Republic who can help us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.61,0:43:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,.没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.37,0:43:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈，你不是说宇宙中最大的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, you say the biggest problem in this universe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.20,0:43:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是人们不互相帮助吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}is nobody helps each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.83,0:43:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎刚他是不想让你的儿子去冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure Qui-Gon doesn't want to put your son in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.84,0:43:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会另想办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find some other way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.21,0:44:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，没有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no other way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.80,0:44:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我不愿意让他去，可他能帮助你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may not like it, but he can help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.01,0:44:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他注定是要帮助你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was meant to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.44,0:44:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真想这么干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.45,0:44:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们的命运寄托在一个孩子身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trusting our fate to a boy we hardly know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.20,0:44:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王是不会同意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The queen will not approve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.37,0:44:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要让女王知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The queen doesn't need to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.37,0:44:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't approve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.12,0:44:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子说你们要资助他参加比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy tells me you want to sponsor him in the race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.87,0:44:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们用什么资助？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.63,0:44:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会是用共和国信贷吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not on the Republic credits, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.05,0:44:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用我的飞船作抵压，作参赛费\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ship will be the entry fee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.72,0:44:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错，不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.55,0:44:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘露比亚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad, huh? Nubian, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.64,0:44:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞船状况良好，只是缺一点零件\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in good order, except for the parts I need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.06,0:44:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子会驾驶什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would the boy ride?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.68,0:44:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次比赛，他把我的飞艇撞毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He smashed up my pod in the last race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.46,0:45:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,得需要较长一段时间来修好它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would take some long time to fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.35,0:45:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不能怪我，真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't my fault. Really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.81,0:45:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是泽布巴用他的排气管袭击我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebulba flashed me with his vents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.57,0:45:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实还是我保住了飞艇，大部分的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually saved the pod, mostly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.07,0:45:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.66,0:45:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子的身手的确不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy's good. No doubts there, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.58,0:45:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在一次赛事中赢了一艘飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have acquired a pod in a game of chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.20,0:45:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是速度最快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fastest ever built.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.00,0:45:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿你不是杀人越货抢来的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you didn't kill anyone I know for it, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.09,0:45:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，你提供飞艇和参赛费…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you supply the pod and the entry fee…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.76,0:45:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提供这孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I supply the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.26,0:45:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢了钱五五分怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We split the winnings 50-50, I think, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.26,0:45:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果说五五分的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's going to be 50-50…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.26,0:45:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那参赛费得由你来预支\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you front the cash for the entry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.02,0:45:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们赢了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we win…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.19,0:45:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,奖金都归你，你给我零件就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you keep all the winnings, minus the cost of the parts I need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.10,0:45:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我们输了的话，我的飞艇归你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we lose, you keep my ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.78,0:45:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么你都合算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, you win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.99,0:46:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,说定了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.54,0:46:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你的朋友是个大傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend is a foolish one, methinks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.76,0:46:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父，要是计划失败了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if this plan fails, Master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.81,0:46:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就困在这里，走不了啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could be stuck here a very long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.64,0:46:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在发求救信息太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it 's too dangerous to call for help…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.31,0:46:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有动力的飞船根本没用，\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a ship without a power supply isn't going to get us anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.81,0:46:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.90,0:46:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个孩子很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's something about this boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.62,0:46:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真该为你的儿子感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be very proud of your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.70,0:46:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他施予，但不求回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gives without any thought of reward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.16,0:46:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,心里毫无贪念\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows nothing of greed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.16,0:46:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.25,0:46:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有超常的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has special powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.92,0:46:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.25,0:46:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能预知将要发生的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can see things before they happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.01,0:47:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他的反应很快，\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why he appears to have such quick reflexes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.93,0:47:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种特徵是绝地武士的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Jedi trait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.93,0:47:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不该过奴隶的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}He deserves better than a slave's life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.85,0:47:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他出生在共和国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had he been born in the Republic, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.54,0:47:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以早点定位他\N{\fnArial\fs30}we would have identified him early.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.64,0:47:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他身上的生命原力很强，也很清晰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Force is unusually strong with him. That much is clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.52,0:47:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他父亲是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was his father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.99,0:47:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.36,0:47:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀了他，生了他，抚养他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I carried him, I gave birth, I raised him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.58,0:47:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也解释不清楚，我怎么怀上他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't explain what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.75,0:47:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you help him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.66,0:47:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.04,0:47:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来解救奴隶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't actually come here to free slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.81,0:47:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哗，是工程机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, a real astro droid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.61,0:48:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么这么幸运？ - 这算什么呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you get so lucky? - That isn't the half of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.49,0:48:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还要参加邦塔大赛呢 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm in the Boonta race tomorrow. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.57,0:48:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.40,0:48:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真会开玩笑，安\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're such a joker, Ani.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.28,0:48:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个你造了好几年了 - 它跑不起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've been working on that for years. - It's never gonna run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.62,0:48:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,走，咱们去打球吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go and play ball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.91,0:48:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好好比赛吧，安 你会被压扁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep racing, Ani. You're gonna be bug squash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.76,0:48:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰那个动力电流夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep away from those energy binders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.26,0:48:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,手要是碰到了那个电流，会麻木好几个小时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your hand gets caught in the beam, it's gonna go numb for hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.85,0:48:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.94,0:48:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的舌头太肥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My tongue is fat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.60,0:48:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的舌头… 扳手\N{\fnArial\fs30}My tongue… Wrench.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.81,0:48:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,扳手丢哪儿了？哦，竟敢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is de wrench? Oh, dare it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.95,0:48:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,被夹住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.62,0:48:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗，我觉得加加这家伙有点奇怪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I find that JarJar creature to be a little odd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.45,0:49:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都不知道它能不能跑起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even know if this thing's gonna run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.41,0:49:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它能跑 - 我想是时候试一试了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It will. - I think it's time we found out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.62,0:49:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你，用这个充电 - 好的，先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, use this power charge. - Yes, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.96,0:49:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来，克斯特，我们让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Kitster. Let's move away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.13,0:49:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.47,0:49:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,安，我卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ani, I'm stuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.01,0:49:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我舌头卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My tongue is fat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.31,0:49:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对，他很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're quite right. He's very odd indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.48,0:49:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.65,0:49:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.58,0:49:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动了！发动了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working! It's working!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.84,0:50:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐好别动，我帮你清理伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay still, Ani. Let me clean this cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.47,0:50:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多星星，每个星星都有行星组成的星系吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's so many. Do they all have a system of planets?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.51,0:50:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,多数都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.52,0:50:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人去过所有星球吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anyone been to'em all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.19,0:50:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not likely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.52,0:50:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要成为第一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna be the first one to see 'em all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.94,0:50:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,安，该睡觉了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ani, bedtime!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.44,0:50:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，没问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we are. Good as new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.32,0:50:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,安，你听见了没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ani, I'm not gonna tell you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.33,0:50:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是干什么？ - 它看你的血液有没有感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Checking your blood for infections.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.87,0:50:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,去睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.54,0:50:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天有你忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a big day tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.62,0:50:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡个好觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep well, Ani.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.25,0:50:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欧比旺？ - 是，师父？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Obi-Wan? - Yes, Master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.38,0:50:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发送过去一个血样，你分析一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need an analysis of this blood sample I'm sending you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.22,0:50:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.64,0:50:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,midi-chlorian的读数是多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a midi-chlorian count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.56,0:50:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,读数非常高\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reading is off the chart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.31,0:50:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经大大超过了两万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over 20, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.31,0:50:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤达师父也没有这么高的读数…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Master Yoda doesn't have a midi-chlorian count that high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.07,0:51:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地武士都没有这么高\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Jedi has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.98,0:51:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.90,0:51:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不太清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.47,0:52:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛以前我就想看看你的飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna see your spaceship the moment the race is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.47,0:52:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心点，我蓝色的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience, my blue friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.35,0:52:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,日落之前你会看到奖金\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have your winnings before the suns set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.73,0:52:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也可以离开这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll be far away from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.65,0:52:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不就你那可爱的飞艇归我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if your ship belongs to me, I think, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.81,0:52:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告你，别玩花样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warn you, no funny business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.32,0:52:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得安纳金赢不了吗？ - 别误解我的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't think Anakin can win? - Don't get me wrongo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.57,0:52:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对那孩子很有信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have great faith in the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.16,0:52:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会为你们赢得荣誉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a credit to your race…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.41,0:52:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我看还是萨布巴能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Sebulba there is going to win, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.75,0:52:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.67,0:52:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会这么想的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.63,0:52:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是赢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always wins!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.51,0:53:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把赌注都押在泽布巴身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am betting heavily on Sebulba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.80,0:53:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我跟你赌 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll take that bet. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.27,0:53:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以我的新赛艇跟你赌，就用…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll wager my new racing pod against, say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.73,0:53:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子和他妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}the boy and his mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.73,0:53:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛艇哪能值两个奴隶，绝对不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pod is worth two slaves, not by a long shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.36,0:53:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只赌那个孩子呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.32,0:53:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让运气来决定吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll let fate decide, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.95,0:53:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么巧，我这刚好带了一粒骰子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just happen to have a chance cube here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.50,0:53:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝色，是那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue, it's the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.67,0:53:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.21,0:53:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}his mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.55,0:53:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次掷骰子你赢了，异乡人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won this small toss, outlander…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.10,0:53:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你是赢不了比赛的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you won't win the race!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.35,0:53:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这没差别！\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it makes little difference!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.24,0:54:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好劝劝你的朋友别赌了，不然他可要输惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better stop your friend's betting or I'll end up owning him too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.91,0:54:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他这话什么意思？ - 待会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What'd he mean by that? - I'll tell you later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.54,0:54:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.04,0:54:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪，太空旅行听起来太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my. Space travel sounds rather perilous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.88,0:54:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你们说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can assure you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.00,0:54:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们别想把我弄上那些可怕的飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will never get me onto one of those dreadful starships.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.01,0:54:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是奇才，安 我确信这次你会做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is so wizard, Ani. I'm sure you'll do it this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.51,0:54:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.72,0:54:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是完成这次比赛啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish the race, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.89,0:54:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来没有赢过比赛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never won a race?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.77,0:54:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是没赢过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.61,0:54:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至没有跑完全程？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even finished?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.73,0:54:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,克斯特说的没错 这次我会跑完全程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kitster's right. I will this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.32,0:54:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.83,0:55:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,极速飞梭大赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Podracers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.01,0:55:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是绝对正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's absolutely right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.97,0:55:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多来自银河系边缘的高手会聚到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a big turnout here from all corners of the outer rim territories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.15,0:55:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见比赛选手移动到他们的起跑线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the contestants are making their way out onto the starting grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.86,0:55:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见来自通德星系的本·奎迪纳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isee Ben Quadinaros from the Tund System.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.37,0:55:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有两界冠军获得者博尔斯·威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two-time winner Boles Roor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.37,0:55:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,泽布巴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebulba!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.59,0:55:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在前一排，靠近起跑位置的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in the front row, nearside pole position…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.80,0:56:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,马·霍力克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma whonic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.01,0:56:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,隆重介绍…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hearty hello…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.18,0:56:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱格·霍法斯特和他的KT9飞艇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Clegg Holdfast and his Voltec KT9 Wasp!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.90,0:56:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,再往后，是伟大的达德·波特…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And back again, it's the mighty Dud Bolt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.03,0:56:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他那非凡的座驾，Vulptereen 327\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that incredible racing machine, the Vulptereen 327.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.95,0:56:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有望成为今天的赢家是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hoping for a big win today…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.37,0:56:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧迪·曼德瑞尔，他曾取得过非凡的战绩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ody Mandrell, with his record-setting pit droid team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.67,0:56:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有最后参赛的年轻的安纳金·天行者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a late entry, young Anakin Skywalker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.05,0:56:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个本地小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}a local boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.05,0:56:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,发令员正进入跑道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the flags are moving out onto the track.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.47,0:57:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,它放屁了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pee yousa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.53,0:57:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.20,0:57:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会赢的，妈妈，我答应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will, Mom. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.72,0:57:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次你死定了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't walk away from this one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.51,0:57:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个小奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}you slave scum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.89,0:57:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就等着瞧吧，烂泥球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't count on it, slime ball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.27,0:57:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会死无葬身之地的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bantha fodder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.23,0:57:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗？ - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all set, Ani? - Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.57,0:57:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.32,0:57:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住，要集中精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, concentrate on the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.08,0:57:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭感觉，别思考，利用本能的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel, don't think. Use your instincts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.95,0:57:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.70,0:57:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,原力与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the Force be with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.88,0:58:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫特人贾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jabba the Hutt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.10,0:58:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.48,0:58:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宣布比赛开始！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begin the race!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.29,0:58:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来他们已经各就各位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, looks like they're clearing the grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.67,0:58:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他紧张吗？ - 他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is he nervous? - He's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.17,0:58:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们绝地武士太鲁莽了，女王是不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Jedi are far too reckless. The queen is not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.17,0:58:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王她信任我，年轻的女仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The queen trusts my judgment, young handmaiden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.17,0:58:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也该信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.51,0:58:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太自以为是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You assume too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.35,0:58:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start your engines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.10,0:59:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，肯定会撞得一塔糊涂，我看不下去了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dissen gonna be messy. Me no watch'n!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.44,1:00:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.36,1:00:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好，天行者的飞艇动不了啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Little Skywalker has stalled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.12,1:00:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪纳斯的引擎好像也出了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like Quadinaros is having engine trouble also.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.91,1:00:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油啊，安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Ani!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.62,1:00:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者飞起来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there goes Skywalker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.33,1:00:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，安，加油！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Ani, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.92,1:00:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得奋力而行才能追上前面的飞艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be hard-pressed to catch up with the leaders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.12,1:01:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像一帮塔斯肯袭击者驻扎在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a few Tusken Raiders are camped out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.16,1:02:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,峡谷拐弯角处\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the canyon dune turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.37,1:02:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么破东西！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doowat macroon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.67,1:02:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪纳斯的引擎给炸毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There goes Quadinaros' power coupling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.12,1:02:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheespa wata!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.82,1:02:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chubba ni chees Sebulba! Paketa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.83,1:02:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kulkah meeka!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.76,1:02:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ody Mandrell coona wa wunda dungo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.10,1:02:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.10,1:02:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金，师父在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Master Anakin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.23,1:02:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看，他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Here he comes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.32,1:03:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者飞越了主赛场\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like Skywalker is moving up in the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.53,1:03:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yay! Yippee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.45,1:03:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他再跑两圈吧？天哪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to complete two more circuits? Oh, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.30,1:04:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrr!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.60,1:04:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者引擎失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skywalker's spinning out of control!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.38,1:05:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你来自哪个星球，这一摔一定也够受的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what universe you're from. That's gotta hurt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.39,1:05:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here he comes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.22,1:05:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在第三也是最后一圈的开始，萨布巴领先…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the start of the third and final lap, Sebulba's in the lead…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.47,1:05:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者紧随其后！\N{\fnArial\fs30}followed closely by Skywalker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.10,1:05:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，安！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Ani!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.99,1:06:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者要撞到服务站了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skywalker's been forced onto the service ramp!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.47,1:06:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.31,1:06:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是天行者！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Skywalker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.64,1:06:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨布巴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebulba!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.09,1:06:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,太精彩了！真精准的控制，他又飞回跑道上了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing! A quick control thrust, and he's back on course!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.46,1:06:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他撞死了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he crash-ed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.00,1:07:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者有麻烦了！泽布巴领先！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skywalker's in trouble! Sebulba takes the lead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.01,1:08:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在追赶泽布巴！ - 看来要追上了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's catching Sebulba! - Inkabunga!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.80,1:08:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心，安，当心，安！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, Ani. Careful, Ani!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.89,1:08:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha… Chuba da noya！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.54,1:08:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人类的小孩真是疯了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little human being is out of his mind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.03,1:09:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们并排飞行！ - 不相上下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're side by side! - Bangu du bangu!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.77,1:09:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.91,1:09:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poo doo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.22,1:09:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yippee! Yay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.22,1:09:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ya eeka buta!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.66,1:09:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.49,1:09:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,观众都沸腾了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crowds are going nuts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.34,1:09:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，安！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yay, Ani!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.72,1:09:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈，我成功了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, I did it! Yay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.27,1:10:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真棒，安！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good going, Ani!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.53,1:10:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我们，安\N{\fnArial\fs30}We owe you everything, Ani.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.12,1:10:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太好了，安\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so wonderful, Ani.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.37,1:10:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我们奴隶带来了希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have brought hope to those who have none.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.21,1:10:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真为你感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so very proud of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.18,1:10:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,库巴，不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oy chuba no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.89,1:10:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.89,1:10:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You swindled me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.31,1:10:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早知道那孩子能赢，你肯定知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew the boy was going to win. Somehow you knew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.23,1:10:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在什么都没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.23,1:10:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你赌博，我的朋友，你就早晚会输\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever you gamble, my friend, eventually you lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.90,1:10:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把零件送到飞船那儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the parts to the main hangar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.49,1:10:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等一会儿到店里去带走那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come by your shop later on so you can release the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.70,1:10:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能把他带走，这是一个不公平赌博\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't have him. It wasn't a fair bet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.75,1:11:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想去赫特人那儿去讲理吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to discuss it with the Hutts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.34,1:11:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们会处理此事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure they can settle this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.34,1:11:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.19,1:11:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hidoe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.86,1:11:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，我们拿到所需要的零件了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we have all the essential parts we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.07,1:11:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.23,1:11:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一些未完成的事情 我不会待太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some unfinished business. I won't be long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.45,1:11:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么感觉到我们又要带上一个可怜的人了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I sense we've picked up another pathetic life-form?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.70,1:11:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个帮我们弄到零件的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the boy who's responsible for getting us these parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.95,1:11:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把超光影速引擎装上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this hyperdrive generator installed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.96,1:11:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，师父，不要多长时间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Master. That shouldn't take long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.63,1:11:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Hup!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.42,1:11:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. These are yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.29,1:11:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.56,1:11:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈，我们把飞艇卖了！看看咱们有多少钱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, we sold the pod! Look at all the money we have!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.44,1:11:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪！那真是太好了，安\N{\fnArial\fs30}My goodness! But that's so wonderful, Ani.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.94,1:11:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而且他成自由之身了 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And he has been freed. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.03,1:12:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不再是奴隶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're no longer a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.74,1:12:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.45,1:12:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你能去实现你自己的梦想了，安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you can make your dreams come true, Ani.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.79,1:12:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.29,1:12:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把他带走吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you take him with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.88,1:12:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会成会绝地武士吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he to become a Jedi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.63,1:12:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我们相会并非是偶然的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Our meeting was not a coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.01,1:12:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事都不是偶然发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing happens by accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.80,1:12:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我可以跟你坐飞船离开这里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean I get to come with you in your starship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.47,1:12:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.81,1:12:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要成为绝地武士并不是容易的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}training to become a Jedi is not an easy challenge…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.23,1:12:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地武士的生活是十分艰难的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and even if you succeed, it's a hard life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.23,1:12:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我想去，我一直梦想成为绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wanna go. It's what I've always dreamed of doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.24,1:12:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I go, Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.33,1:12:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.12,1:12:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活的道路已经在你脚下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this path has been placed before you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.16,1:12:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该由你自己决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}The choice is yours alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.30,1:12:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.76,1:13:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就收拾好东西，我们的时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then pack your things. We haven't much time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.00,1:13:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yippee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.60,1:13:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那妈妈呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.32,1:13:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也自由了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she free too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.32,1:13:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想解救你妈妈，可瓦图不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to free your mother, Ani, but Watto wouldn't have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.87,1:13:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也和我们一起走吧，妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming with us, aren't you, Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.83,1:13:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子，我只能留下，这是我的归宿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, my place is here. My future is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.30,1:13:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候让你走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is time for you to let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.80,1:13:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想就这么离开你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want things to change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.05,1:13:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这是命中注定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't stop the change…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.56,1:13:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你改变不了就像太阳要落山一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}any more than you can stop the suns from setting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.73,1:13:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.32,1:13:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.75,1:14:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.25,1:14:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会照顾他的，你放心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll watch after him. You have my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.42,1:14:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会有事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you be all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.38,1:14:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.89,1:14:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，安纳金主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Master Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.60,1:14:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,C-3PO，我自由了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, 3PO, I've been freed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.81,1:14:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要坐飞船离开这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm going away in a starship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.31,1:14:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金主人，你造了我，我祝你平安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Anakin, you are my maker and I wish you well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.36,1:14:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我真希望你能给我装个外壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, I should prefer it if I were a little more completed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.70,1:14:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，我没能把你做完，3PO…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I wasn't able to finish you, 3PO…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.95,1:14:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,本该给你装外壳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}give you coverings and all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.12,1:14:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna miss working on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.87,1:14:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个了不起的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been a great pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.46,1:14:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉妈妈别把你卖掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make sure Mom doesn't sell you or anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.88,1:14:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖掉我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.05,1:14:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.80,1:14:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.83,1:15:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能走，妈妈，我真的不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do it, Mom. I just can't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.29,1:15:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ani.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.33,1:15:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能见到你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will I ever see you again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.80,1:15:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的内心怎么说的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does your heart tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.01,1:15:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.68,1:15:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.68,1:15:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.31,1:15:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就会再见面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we will see each other again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.61,1:15:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来解救你的，妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will come back and free you, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.53,1:15:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.50,1:15:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，勇敢些…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, be brave…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.25,1:15:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别回头看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and don't look back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.05,1:16:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要回头看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.52,1:16:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎刚先生，等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Qui-Gon, sir, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.72,1:16:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我累了！ - 安纳金！趴下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm tired! - Anakin! Drop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.94,1:16:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.94,1:16:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们起飞！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them to take off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.46,1:17:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎刚有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Qui-Gon's in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.21,1:17:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.30,1:17:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿，飞低点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there. Fly low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.65,1:17:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没受伤吧？ - 好像没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you all right? - I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.78,1:17:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.45,1:17:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不清楚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.33,1:17:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他精通绝地技艺\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was well-trained in the Jedi arts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.12,1:17:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是来抓女王的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guess is it was after the queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.63,1:17:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么办呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.09,1:17:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得耐心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall be patient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.84,1:17:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,安尼金·天行者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin Skywalker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.09,1:17:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识一下欧比旺·肯诺比\N{\fnArial\fs30}meet Obi-Wan Kenobi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.12,1:17:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.31,1:18:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是绝地武士？很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a Jedi too? Pleased to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.82,1:18:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的女王不见了，你们的人民在挨饿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your queen is lost, your people are starving…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.49,1:18:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你，执政官，你会死…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you, Governor, are going to die…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.62,1:18:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们的人民之前，我害怕是\N{\fnArial\fs30}much sooner than your people, I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.87,1:18:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们入侵不会得逞\N{\fnArial\fs30}This invasion will gain you nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.50,1:18:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是民主星球，一切由人民决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're a democracy. The people have decided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.63,1:18:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.97,1:18:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的军队正在开始搜索沼泽里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My troops are in position to begin searching the swamps…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.55,1:18:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些传说中的水下村庄\N{\fnArial\fs30}for these rumoured underwater villages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.22,1:18:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们藏不了多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will not stay hidden for long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.90,1:18:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人民死伤惨重\N{\fnArial\fs30}The death toll is catastrophic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.74,1:18:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是让步吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must bow to their wishes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.49,1:18:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须跟我取得联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must contact me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.85,1:19:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.81,1:19:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我特别冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.69,1:19:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来自一个温暖的星球，安\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come from a warm planet, Ani.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.57,1:19:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于我来说太温暖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little too warm for my taste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.07,1:19:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空是冷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Space is cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.45,1:19:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不太高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.75,1:19:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王很着急\N{\fnArial\fs30}The queen is worried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.13,1:19:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,.她的人民正面临死亡的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her people are suffering, dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.67,1:19:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她必须说服国会出面干涉\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must convince the senate to intervene or…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.63,1:19:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不知道能不能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure what'll happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.39,1:19:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我为你做的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made this for you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.93,1:19:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你能记住我\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you'd remember me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.52,1:19:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我用甲板木刻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I carved it out of a japor snippet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.31,1:19:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会给你带来好运的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll bring you good fortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.28,1:20:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.28,1:20:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我不带着它也会记得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't need this to remember you by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.33,1:20:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了首府后会发生很多变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many things will change when we reach the capital, Ani…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.83,1:20:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我对你的关心不会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my caring for you will remain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.09,1:20:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会关心你的，只是我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I care for you, too, only l…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.34,1:20:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想你妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.99,1:20:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,克罗肯特整个星球，就是一座大城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coruscant. The entire planet is one big city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.29,1:20:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是首相飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Chancellor Valorum's shuttle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.16,1:20:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那边，帕尔帕庭议员正等着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look over there. Senator Palpatine is waiting for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.91,1:21:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你安然无恙我就放心了，女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a great gift to see you alive, Your Majesty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.08,1:21:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,通讯中断了，我们都很为你担心，\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the communications break down, we've been very concerned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.17,1:21:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想听你带回的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm anxious to hear your report on the situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.75,1:21:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来介绍：这位是首相维罗伦先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I present Supreme Chancellor Valorum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.50,1:21:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你，女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.59,1:21:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸我终于见到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an honour to finally meet you in person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.76,1:21:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Supreme Chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.34,1:21:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家对目前的局势都感到忧心忡忡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must relay to you how distressed everyone is over the current situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.97,1:21:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我召集了国会特别会议听取你的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've called for a special session of the senate to hear your position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.56,1:21:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你多费心了，首相先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm grateful for your concern, Chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.77,1:21:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,议程中有个问题…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a question of procedure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.78,1:21:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我还是相信能够解决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm confident we can overcome it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.11,1:21:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在得马上去绝地长老院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must speak with the Jedi Council immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.41,1:21:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的情况变得越来越复杂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The situation has become much more complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.96,1:22:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,安，走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ani, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.10,1:22:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王心地不错，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Da queen's a bein grossly nice, mesa tinks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.14,1:22:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真热闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pitty hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.01,1:22:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有正义可言，只有政治\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no civility, only politics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.43,1:22:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,共和国已经不是从前的共和国了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Republic is not what it once was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.44,1:23:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,国会中尽是那些贪得无厌的议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The senate is full of greedy, squabbling delegates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.49,1:23:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们根本不关心人民的利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no interest in the common good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.78,1:23:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must be frank, Your Majesty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.54,1:23:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,国会很难阻止贸易联盟的入侵行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is little chance the senate will act on the invasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.37,1:23:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,维罗伦首相认为还有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chancellor Valorum seems to think there is hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.21,1:23:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就明说了吧，女王陛下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I may say so, Your Majesty…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.21,1:23:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相其实并没有什么实权\N{\fnArial\fs30}the chancellor has little real power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.55,1:23:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被毫无根据的贪污控告所困住\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is mired by baseless accusations of corruption.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.55,1:23:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 官僚现在掌握大权 - 我们有什么办法吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The bureaucrats are in charge now. - What options have we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.06,1:23:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先我们应该马上重新选举出…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our best choice would be to push for the election…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.06,1:23:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位强干的共和国首相…\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a stronger supreme chancellor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.40,1:23:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,能约束那些贪官污吏…\N{\fnArial\fs30}one who could control the bureaucrats…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.69,1:23:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,主持公道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and give us justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.40,1:23:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可对维罗伦首相任职期间的工作投不信任票\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could call for a vote of no confidence in Chancellor Valorum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.03,1:23:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直是我们强有力的支持者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has been our strongest supporter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.66,1:23:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那另外一个办法就是只有向法院起诉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our only other choice would be to submit a plea to the courts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.00,1:23:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,上法院比国会争论更花时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The courts take even longer to decide things than the senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.26,1:24:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人民面临死亡，议员先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our people are dying, Senator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.13,1:24:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须想办法马上阻止联盟的入侵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must do something quickly to stop the Federation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.26,1:24:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看现在这局去势，女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be realistic, Your Majesty…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.89,1:24:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我觉得还是接受联盟的控制…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're going to have to accept Federation control…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.52,1:24:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就目前来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the time being.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.77,1:24:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我决不能接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is something I cannot do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.20,1:24:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的绝地技艺很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was trained in the Jedi arts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.91,1:24:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个西斯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My only conclusion can be that it was a Sith lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.96,1:24:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.46,1:24:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,西斯人一千年前就灭绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sith have been extinct for a millennium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.25,1:24:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信，西斯人回来了我们会不知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not believe the Sith could have returned without us knowing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.43,1:24:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那其中的阴暗面很难看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard to see, the dark side is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.76,1:24:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要尽全力解开这个谜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will use all our resources to unravel this mystery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.77,1:24:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要弄清那个武士的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will discover the identity of your attacker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.10,1:24:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿力与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the Force be with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.82,1:24:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等，奎刚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Qui-Gon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.15,1:24:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有什么要说的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}More to say have you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.08,1:25:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your permission, my master…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.50,1:25:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现原力在集结\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have encountered a vergence in the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.63,1:25:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,原力在集结？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A vergence, you say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.75,1:25:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指在一个人的身上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Located around a person?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.00,1:25:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.38,1:25:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的细胞中含有很高的超能素…\N{\fnArial\fs30}His cells have the highest concentration of midi-chlorians…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.01,1:25:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前从未见到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have seen in a life-form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.93,1:25:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也许就是由超能素孕育而生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is possible he was conceived by the midi-chlorians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.52,1:25:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你提到那个大预言中说的那个给原力带来平衡的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You refer to the prophecy of the one who will bring balance to the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.19,1:25:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信就是这个孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe it's this boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.44,1:25:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我并没有说… - 可你相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't presume to… - But you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.78,1:25:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经说得很明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revealed your opinion is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.86,1:25:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让他接受测试吧，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}I request the boy be tested, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.04,1:25:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想把他训练成一个绝地武士吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trained as a Jedi you request for him, hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.37,1:25:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是原力让我找到他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finding him was the will of the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.88,1:25:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不怀疑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no doubt of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.80,1:25:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就把他带来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him before us, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.94,1:26:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个孩子要见帕德梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy's here to see Padme{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.95,1:26:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.74,1:26:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，安，但帕德梅现在不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Ani, but Padmes not here right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.75,1:26:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.21,1:26:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金·天行者来见帕德梅，女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin Skywalker to see Padme Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.34,1:26:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕德梅为我办事去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've sent Padme on an errand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.25,1:26:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要去绝地圣堂…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my way to the Jedi temple…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.26,1:26:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始我的训练，但愿是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}to start my training, I hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.34,1:26:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我再也见不到她了，所以来向她告别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may never see her again, so I came to say goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.27,1:26:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会转达的 她一定会为你祝福\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will tell her for you. We are sure her heart goes with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.02,1:26:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您，女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.08,1:26:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,主席认可这位来自纳布星球的议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chair recognizes the senator from the sovereign system of Naboo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.97,1:27:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,共和国首相，国会议员们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supreme Chancellor, delegates of the senate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.47,1:27:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一场悲剧发生了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}a tragedy has occurred…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.98,1:27:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,起因就是国会在贸易通道上征税…\N{\fnArial\fs30}which started right here with the taxation of trade routes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.60,1:27:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且现在吞并了我们整个星球…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and has now engulfed our entire planet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.73,1:27:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在贸易联盟的巨大压力之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the oppression of the Trade Federation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.61,1:27:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说太过分了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is outrageous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.16,1:27:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们反对这位议员的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I object to the senator's statements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.83,1:27:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,本主席现在还没允许贸易联盟的议员发言\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chair does not recognize the senator from the Trade Federation at this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.00,1:27:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了表明我们的主张，我提出由阿米达拉女王…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To state our allegations, I present Queen Amidala…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.00,1:27:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她最近当选为纳布星的最高统治者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}recently elected ruler of the Naboo…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.13,1:27:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的讲话代表了我方\N{\fnArial\fs30}who speaks on our behalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.01,1:27:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位尊敬的共和国议员…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honourable representatives of the Republic…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.52,1:27:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是冒着生命危险来见各位的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come to you under the gravest of circumstances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.10,1:27:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳布星球遭到了贸易联盟的入侵…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Naboo system has been invaded by the droid armies of the Trade…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.11,1:27:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我反对！这话没有依据！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I object! There is no proof!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.78,1:27:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.78,1:28:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们建议派代表团到纳布星去查明真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}We recommend a commission be sent to Naboo to ascertain the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.87,1:28:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,马拉斯代尔星球国会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Congress of Malastare…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.29,1:28:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意尊敬的贸易联盟代表的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}concurs with the honourable delegate from the Trade Federation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.41,1:28:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该派代表团去\N{\fnArial\fs30}A commission must be appointed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.58,1:28:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 问题是… - 对不起，首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The point… - Excuse me, Chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.21,1:28:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这些官僚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enter the bureaucrat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.96,1:28:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在幕后操纵着国会\N{\fnArial\fs30}The true rulers of the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.72,1:28:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,贸易联盟已经把他们都收买了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on the payroll of the Trade Federation, I might add.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.01,1:28:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,维罗伦首相拿这帮家伙一点办法也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where Chancellor Valorum's strength will disappear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.81,1:28:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,提议被采纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is conceded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.23,1:28:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,等代表团查明真相以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you defer your motion to allow a commission…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.98,1:28:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许会改变你的陈述\N{\fnArial\fs30}to explore the validity of your accusations?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.90,1:28:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会改变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not defer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.91,1:28:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来请你们阻止他们的入侵行动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come before you to resolve this attack on our sovereignty now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.53,1:28:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我眼看着我的人民在受苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was not elected to watch my people suffer and die…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.66,1:28:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却在谈论什么代表团\N{\fnArial\fs30}while you discuss this invasion in a committee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.29,1:28:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果国会无力处理此事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this body is not capable of action…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.76,1:28:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议重选一位共和国首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest new leadership is needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.22,1:29:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把完全不信任票投给…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I move for a vote of no confidence…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.56,1:29:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,维罗伦首相的领导能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Chancellor Valorum's leadership.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.61,1:29:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即投票！立即投票！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vote now! Vote now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.57,1:29:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,秩序！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Order!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.62,1:29:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们要选出一位新首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they will elect a new chancellor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.62,1:29:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位能干的首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}a strong chancellor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.62,1:29:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该能结束我们的悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}one who will not let our tragedy continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.25,1:29:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金没能通过长老院的测试，他年龄太大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy will not pass the council's test, Master. He's too old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.63,1:29:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会成为绝地武士的，我敢肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin will become a Jedi, I promise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.89,1:29:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再违背长老们的意愿了，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not defy the council, Master, not again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.72,1:29:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事我必须做，欧比旺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall do what I must, Obi-Wan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.35,1:29:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你守规矩，你早就已经当长老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you would just follow the code, you would be on the council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.23,1:29:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们这次是不会答应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will not go along with you this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.78,1:29:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要学的东西还多着呐，你太年轻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still have much to learn, my young apprentice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.66,1:29:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.66,1:30:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,杯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.75,1:30:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是船\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.67,1:30:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩托艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}A speeder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.68,1:30:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么感觉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How feel you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.18,1:30:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,感到冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.52,1:30:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你害怕吗？ - 不害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Afraid are you? - No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.86,1:30:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能看透你\N{\fnArial\fs30}See through you we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.61,1:30:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意你自己的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be mindful of your feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.61,1:30:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的思想集中在你妈妈身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your thoughts dwell on your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.03,1:30:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.70,1:30:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,害怕失去她，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid to lose her, I think, mmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.29,1:30:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和你们的测试有什么关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What has that got to do with anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.54,1:30:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.00,1:30:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧是原力的阴暗面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear is the path to the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.17,1:30:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧导致愤怒，愤怒导致仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear leads to anger. Anger leads to hate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.18,1:30:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,仇恨带来痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hate leads to suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.06,1:30:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到你很恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sense much fear in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.91,1:31:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你的人民会面临死亡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yousa tinking yousa people ganna die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.42,1:31:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.09,1:31:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,冈根人也会被杀死吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gungans get pasted too, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.43,1:31:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.26,1:31:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,冈根人是绝不会坐以待毙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gungans no die'n without a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.60,1:31:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是战土\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wesa warriors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.60,1:31:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有庞大的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wesa got a grand army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.98,1:31:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们都喜欢我们，陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dat's why you no liken us, mesa tinks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.32,1:31:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Highness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.32,1:31:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Highness…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.57,1:31:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕尔帕庭议员被提名参加…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator Palpatine has been nominated to succeed Valorum…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.79,1:31:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一任首相的选举\N{\fnArial\fs30}as supreme chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.29,1:31:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没想到，不过的确是个好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}A surprise, to be sure, but a welcome one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.29,1:31:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下，如果我当选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, if I am elected, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.48,1:31:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证一定要惩治腐败\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise to put an end to corruption.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.80,1:31:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,被提名的还有谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else has been nominated?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.59,1:32:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥德兰星的贝尔·安德烈斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bail Antilles of Alderaan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.74,1:32:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,和马拉斯代尔星的安利·蒂姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Ainlee Teem of Malastare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.01,1:32:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信我们的处境将会得到大量的同情票\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel confident our situation will create a strong sympathy vote for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.65,1:32:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会成为首相的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.77,1:32:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心等到你掌握国会大权的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear by the time you have control of the bureaucrats, Senator…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.48,1:32:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们纳布星的人民已经惨遭灭绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}there'll be nothing left of our people, our way of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.82,1:32:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的担心我很理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand your concern, Your Majesty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.82,1:32:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是联盟已经控制了纳布星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, the Federation has possession of our planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.16,1:32:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是你的战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator, this is your arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.33,1:32:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我还是回去我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel I must return to mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.51,1:32:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定回纳布星去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've decided to go back to Naboo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.93,1:32:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.93,1:32:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下，现实一点，贸易联盟的人会强迫你签协议的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Your Majesty, be realistic. They'll force you to sign the treaty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.01,1:32:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么协议也不会签\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will sign no treaty, Senator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.52,1:32:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和我的人民生死与共\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fate will be no different than that of our people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.44,1:32:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 船长 - 女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain. - Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.15,1:32:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 备好我的飞船 - 求你了，陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready my ship. - Please, Your Majesty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.57,1:32:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你留下来，这里才安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here where it's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.94,1:32:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显，国会已经失去它的作用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is clear to me now that the Republic no longer functions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.87,1:33:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你能重新唤起国会的理智和同情心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray you will bring sanity and compassion back to the senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.72,1:33:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他体内的原力很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Force is strong with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.43,1:33:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他可以受训了，是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is to be trained, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.47,1:33:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，他不能接受训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he will not be trained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.98,1:33:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.69,1:33:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他年龄太大\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is too old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.86,1:33:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是命中注定的，这你应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the chosen one. You must see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.82,1:33:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子的未来乌云密布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clouded this boy's future is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.58,1:33:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要训练他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will train him, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.75,1:33:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要收安纳金肯做我的徒弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take Anakin as my Padawan learner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.71,1:33:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经有一个徒弟了，奎刚\N{\fnArial\fs30}An apprentice you have, Qui-Gon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.76,1:33:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再收第二个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible to take on a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.26,1:33:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不合规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The code forbids it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.06,1:33:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欧比旺已经准备好了 - 我己准备好接受考验了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Obi-Wan is ready. - I am ready to face the trials.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.56,1:34:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们长老院将自己安排谁该接受考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our own counsel we will keep on who is ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.19,1:34:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他虽然脾气倔，关于原力还有很多要学的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is headstrong and he has much to learn of the living Force…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.94,1:34:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他很有能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he is capable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.78,1:34:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经没有什么可教他的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is little more he can learn from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.37,1:34:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,小天行者的命运以后再做决定吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young Skywalker's fate will be decided later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.29,1:34:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now is not the time for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.67,1:34:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,国会正在选举新的首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}The senate is voting for a new supreme chancellor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.75,1:34:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿米达拉女王准备返回纳布星…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Queen Amidala is returning home…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.55,1:34:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会对联盟产生压力，冲突可能会扩大\N{\fnArial\fs30}which puts pressure on the Federation and could widen the confrontation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.88,1:34:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且可能把那个武士引出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And draw out the queen's attacker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.30,1:34:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,和女王一起去纳布星，查明那位神秘武士的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go with the queen to Naboo and discover the identity of this dark warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.98,1:34:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们揭开西斯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the clue we need…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.64,1:34:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,神秘面纱的重要线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}to unravel the mystery of the Sith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.94,1:34:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,原动力与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the Force be with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.33,1:34:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是不尊重你，师父，这是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not disrespect, Master. It's the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.34,1:35:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是你的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}From your point of view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.34,1:35:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子很危险，他们都感觉到了，你怎么就不能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy is dangerous. They all sense it. Why can't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.84,1:35:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的命运还没有决定，他并不危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}His fate is uncertain. He's not dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.85,1:35:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,长老院要决定那孩子的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}The council will decide Anakin's future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.35,1:35:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你满意了吧，好了，上船吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should be enough for you. Now get on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.94,1:35:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎刚先生，我真的不想给你添麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Qui-Gon, sir, I don't want to be a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.82,1:35:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有，安\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't be, Ani.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.16,1:35:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不想让我训练你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not allowed to train you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.20,1:35:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以看我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I want you to watch me and be mindful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.37,1:35:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远记住：\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always remember:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.37,1:35:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,专注程度决定了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your focus determines your reality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.13,1:35:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧跟着我，你不会有危险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay close to me and you'll be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.84,1:35:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎刚师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master, sir…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.34,1:35:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见尤达师父在说什么超能素\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard Yoda talking about midi-chlorians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.05,1:35:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想知道… 什么是超能素？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been wondering… What are midi-chlorians?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.85,1:35:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所谓超能素是指生活在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Midi-chlorians are a microscopic life-form…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.35,1:35:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命细胞中的一种微生物体\N{\fnArial\fs30}that resides within all living cells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.07,1:35:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们在我身体里吗？ - 对，在你的细胞里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They live inside me? - Inside your cells, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.07,1:36:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们和它是共生关系 - 共生关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And we are symbionts with them. - Symbionts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.66,1:36:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是共同生存互相利用的生命体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life-forms living together for mutual advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.66,1:36:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有超能素，生命就不存在了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the midi-chlorians, life could not exist…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.66,1:36:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也就就失去了原力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we would have no knowledge of the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.58,1:36:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是超能素源源不断的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They continually speak to us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.59,1:36:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们提供的原力\N{\fnArial\fs30}telling us the will of the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.38,1:36:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你静下心来\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you learn to quiet your mind…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.59,1:36:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就能感觉到它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll hear them speaking to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.59,1:36:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.60,1:36:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练一段时间后，你就明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With time and training, Ani, you will. You will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.15,1:36:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下，我们很荣幸能为你继续保驾护航\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, it is our pleasure to continue to serve and protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.61,1:36:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I welcome your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.15,1:36:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕尔帕庭议员担心贸易联盟企图杀死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator Palpatine fears that the Federation means to destroy me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.99,1:36:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让他们得逞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you I will not allow that to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.12,1:36:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要回家了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wesa goin' home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.12,1:36:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧，R2\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.26,1:36:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,占领纳布星了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the planet secure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.77,1:37:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚占领了最后几个土着人的聚居点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have taken over the last pockets of primitive life-forms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.77,1:37:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经完全控制了纳布星\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are in complete control of the planet now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.98,1:37:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 还要保证继续让国会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. I will see to it that in the senate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.28,1:37:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,受我们的操纵…\N{\fnArial\fs30}things stay as they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.32,1:37:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会派我的徒弟，达斯·摩尔，跟你们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sending my apprentice, Darth Maul, to join you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.95,1:37:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.95,1:37:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,西斯人要来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Sith here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.25,1:37:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是前进稳定器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are the forward stabilizers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.84,1:37:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两个是控制高度的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those two control the pitch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.80,1:37:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你学得可真快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You catch on pretty quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.80,1:37:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一着陆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as we land…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.68,1:37:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,贸易联盟的人就会强迫你在他们的协议上签字的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Federation will arrest you and force you to sign the treaty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.44,1:37:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.60,1:37:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你这样做有什么意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure what you wish to accomplish by this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.48,1:37:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回去收复失地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take back what's ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.74,1:37:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人太少，女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are too few of us, Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.03,1:37:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们又没有军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.03,1:37:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仅能保护你的人生安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can only protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.53,1:37:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不能为你去打仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't fight a war for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.62,1:37:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,加加·宾克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jar Jar Binks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.58,1:37:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我吗，女王陛下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa, Your Highness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.88,1:38:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.05,1:38:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了一艘战舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have one battleship on my scope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.39,1:38:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是由机器人驾驶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a droid control ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.56,1:38:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能已经发现我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've probably spotted us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.89,1:38:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't much time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.32,1:38:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,加加正在赶往冈根城，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jar Jar is on his way to the Gungan city, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.12,1:38:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.54,1:38:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得女王的计划能行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think the queen's idea will work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.92,1:38:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,冈根人不是那么好动摇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Gungans will not be easily swayed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.63,1:38:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不能用我们的力量帮助她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we cannot use our power to help her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.76,1:38:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 我向你道歉，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for my behaviour, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.97,1:38:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于那孩子我不该对你的意见表示异议\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my place to disagree with you about the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.60,1:38:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉我可以接受考验了，我很感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am grateful you think I'm ready to take the trials.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.06,1:38:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好徒弟，欧比旺\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been a good apprentice, Obi-Wan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.40,1:39:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的智慧已经超过我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're a much wiser man than I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.78,1:39:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会成会一个伟大的绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I foresee you will become a great Jedi knight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.13,1:39:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿一个人也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desa nobody dare!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.63,1:39:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,冈根城是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Gungan city is deserted!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.93,1:39:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看是打过仗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kinda fight, mesa tinks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.60,1:39:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是被送到集中营去了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think they have been taken to the camps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.81,1:39:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能是被消灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}More likely they were wiped out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.27,1:39:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可不这么看 - 知道他们在哪儿，扎扎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mesa no tink so. - Do you know where they are, Jar Jar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.44,1:39:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有危险的时候冈根人就会去圣地\N{\fnArial\fs30}When in trouble, Gungans go to sacred place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.99,1:39:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你们去，走啊，跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa show you. Come on. Mesa show you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.22,1:40:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,首领大人，纳布星的阿米达拉女王到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Honour, Queen Amidala of the Naboo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.48,1:40:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊，纳斯大首领，我的大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heyo dadee Big Boss Nass, Your Honour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.61,1:40:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,加加宾克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jar Jar Binks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.53,1:40:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是些什么人啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's da uss-en uthers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.37,1:40:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是纳布星的阿米达拉女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Queen Amidala of the Naboo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.50,1:40:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到这儿来没有敌意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come before you in peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.04,1:40:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳布大人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Naboo biggen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.00,1:40:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们把机器人部队带来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yousa bringen da Mackineeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.30,1:40:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,自以为了不起吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yousa all bombad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.89,1:40:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到这儿来是想和你结盟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have searched you out because we wish to form an alliance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.85,1:40:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,首领大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Honour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.39,1:40:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whosa dis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.48,1:40:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是阿米达拉女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Queen Amidala.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.36,1:40:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的替身…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my decoy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.07,1:40:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是保护我的，她是我忠诚的保镖\N{\fnArial\fs30}my protection, my loyal bodyguard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.83,1:41:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉欺骗你，但这是保护我自己的必要手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for my deception, but it was necessary to protect myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.25,1:41:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我们之间也有分歧，首领大人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although we do not always agree, Your Honour…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.92,1:41:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们之间一直是相安无事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}our two great societies have always lived in peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.25,1:41:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,贸易联盟毁灭了我们所有辛苦工作的成果\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Trade Federation has destroyed all that we have worked so hard to build.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.55,1:41:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不马上采取行动，后果将不堪设想\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we do not act quickly, all will be lost forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.93,1:41:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请你帮助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask you to help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.27,1:41:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我求你帮助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I beg you to help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.10,1:41:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是你卑下的奴仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are your humble servants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.73,1:41:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的命运掌握在你手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our fate is in your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.76,1:41:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不觉得你们自己比我们冈根人优越了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yousa no tinken yousa greater den da Gungans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.47,1:41:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我很高兴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa lika dis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.44,1:41:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.44,1:42:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}wesa…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.11,1:42:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,能成为朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}being friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.70,1:42:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们派出了巡逻艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've sent our patrols.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.62,1:42:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在沼泽地发现了他们的飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already located their starship in the swamp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.21,1:42:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要找到他们了，大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't be long, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.50,1:42:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到她会回纳布星\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an unexpected move for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.76,1:42:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太冒险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It 's too aggressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.88,1:42:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,达斯摩罗，你要当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Maul, be mindful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.43,1:42:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们先动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them make the first move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.10,1:42:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.52,1:42:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deysa comin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.31,1:42:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.24,1:42:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.07,1:42:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，他们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. They made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.04,1:42:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干得真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yousa doen grand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.83,1:42:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,加加让我们和纳布人结成同盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jar Jar bring uss-en and da Naboo together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.04,1:42:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不，不，不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.05,1:43:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以，现在我任命你为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, wesa make you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.13,1:43:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,冈根的大将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}bombad general.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.76,1:43:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军？\N{\fnArial\fs30}General?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.27,1:43:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.85,1:43:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 女王陛下 - 情况怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Highness. - What is the situation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.56,1:43:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们都被关在集中营里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost everyone's in camps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.57,1:43:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些警察和卫兵秘密组成了地下抵抗抵抗组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few hundred police and guards formed an underground resistance movement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.90,1:43:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽量把抵抗组职的头领带来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought back as many of the leaders as I could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.57,1:43:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,贸易联盟的军队比我想像的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Federation army's also much larger than we thought…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.57,1:43:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,强大得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}and much stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.54,1:43:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下，这场战斗我们很难取胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Highness, this is a battle I do not think that we can win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.75,1:43:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗只是个幌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The battle is a diversion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.08,1:43:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,冈根人会把机器人部队引到城外\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Gungans must draw the droid army away from the cities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.09,1:43:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ｒ２\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.76,1:43:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以通过瀑布下面的秘密通道进到城里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can enter the city using the secret passages on the waterfall side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.35,1:43:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一到主要入口…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we get to the main entrance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.18,1:43:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长就开始进行佯政\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Panaka will create a diversion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.39,1:43:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我们就进入宫殿抓住总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we can enter the palace and capture the viceroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.06,1:43:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了总督，他们就会乱作一团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the viceroy, they will be lost and confused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.98,1:43:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看的，绝地大师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, Master Jedi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.78,1:43:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,宫殿一定会戒备森严的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The viceroy will be well-guarded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.07,1:43:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得想办法进入正殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The difficulty is getting into the throne room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.70,1:44:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要一进去，就不会有什么问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we're inside, we shouldn't have a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.12,1:44:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行佯攻损失会很大，很多冈根人可能会战死\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a possibility, with this diversion, many Gungans will be killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.96,1:44:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们冈根人是不怕牺牲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wesa ready to do our-san part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.38,1:44:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一个计划，可以瓦解机器人部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a plan which should immobilize the droid army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.63,1:44:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要派战斗机\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will send what pilots we have…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.63,1:44:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,去摧毁控制机器人部队的指挥舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}to knock out the droid control ship orbiting the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.80,1:44:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划倒是不错，可那太冒险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A well-conceived plan. However, there's great risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.97,1:44:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的武器很难穿透他们的防护罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The weapons on your fighters may not penetrate the shields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.23,1:44:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个更大的危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an even bigger danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.98,1:44:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果总督逃脱了，女王陛下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the viceroy escapes, Your Highness…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.98,1:44:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会带更多的机器人部队来这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he will return with another droid army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.32,1:44:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们抓捕总督的行动，一定要成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is why we must not fail to get the viceroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.66,1:44:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们成败的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything depends on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.91,1:44:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王比我想像的还要傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is more foolish than I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.67,1:44:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们派出了所有部队…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are sending all troops…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.75,1:44:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,到沼泽地集结，准备迎敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}to meet this army assembling near the swamp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.76,1:44:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的军队似乎都是土着人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears to be made up of primitives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.51,1:44:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我们十分有利\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will work to our advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.18,1:44:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意我对他们发起进攻吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have your approval to proceed, then, my lord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.77,1:45:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wipe them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.19,1:45:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个不留\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.97,1:45:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.81,1:45:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动防护罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting up the shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.60,1:46:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.91,1:46:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们一进去，你就找个安全的地方躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we get inside, you find a safe place to hide and stay there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.25,1:46:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 别乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. - Stay there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.14,1:46:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火，开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, roger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.24,1:47:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为战场会离这儿很远呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the battle was going to take place far from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.45,1:47:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is too close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.92,1:47:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,安，快躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ani, find cover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.42,1:47:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快！ - 快上飞艇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Quick! - Get to your ships!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.49,1:48:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意前方敌机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighters straight ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.74,1:48:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到，2号明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, Bravo Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.99,1:48:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到，2号明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, Bravo Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.88,1:48:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,停火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cease fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.51,1:48:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住，稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady. Steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.05,1:49:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 启动机器人 - 是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Activate the droids. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.78,1:49:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.80,1:49:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.16,1:50:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜总督就在正殿里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guess is the viceroy's in the throne room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.12,1:50:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,红队！蓝队！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red group! Blue group!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.71,1:50:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都到这边来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, this way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.63,1:50:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂，等等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait for me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.80,1:50:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,安，别出来，呆在座舱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin, stay where you are. You'll be safe there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.30,1:50:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是我… - 那儿很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I… - Stay in that cockpit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.48,1:50:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们来对付他 - 我们绕道过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll handle this. - We'll take the long way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.88,1:51:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也可以干点什么，对吧，R2\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta do something, R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.62,1:51:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找了，可我找不到开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to! I don't know where the trigger is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.08,1:51:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，不是那个，也许是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops, wrong one. Maybe it's this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.51,1:51:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，等等，是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. Wait. Here it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.14,1:51:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.73,1:51:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，是自动驾驶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on automatic pilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.08,1:52:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想自己驾驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to override it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.02,1:53:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能在这耽搁太久，船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time for this, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.07,1:53:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看，他们在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.03,1:53:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他就自动飞到这儿来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where the autopilot's taking us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.43,1:53:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢机器人，我踢死你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumb droid. Take that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.18,1:53:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开！走开！走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off! Get off! Get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.23,1:53:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.45,1:53:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的导向防护罩很坚固\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deflector shield is too strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.13,1:53:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真够紧张的啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is tense!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.09,1:54:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，别让他自动驾驶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, get us off this autopilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.22,1:54:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我门都会把命送掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna get us both killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.76,1:54:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做到了，R2！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it, R2!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.31,1:54:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，咱们往左飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.73,1:54:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.98,1:54:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎刚让我呆在座舱里，我也没出去呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Qui-Gon told me to stay in this cockpit, so that's what I'm gonna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.16,1:54:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我转一圈 晃他们一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try spinning. That's a good trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.30,1:54:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道很危险，坐稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know we're in trouble. Just hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.68,1:54:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.52,1:54:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,换钩枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ascension guns!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.42,1:57:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退！快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retreat! Retreat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.80,1:57:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dis is nutsen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.60,1:57:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,超大的能源球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh. Big boomers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.29,1:57:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉兄弟一把！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a lift!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.97,1:57:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,加加，用能源球！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jar Jar, usen da booma!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.68,1:57:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？没有能源球！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Mesa no have a booma!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.73,1:57:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你，用这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Taken dis one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.12,1:58:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,加加！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jar Jar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.33,1:58:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跳，加加，快跳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump, Jar Jar, jump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.47,1:58:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器吧 这一仗他们赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put down your weapons. They win this round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.20,1:58:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被打中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're hit, R2!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.55,1:58:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快停下来，快停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to stop! I'm trying to stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.72,1:59:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动机过热了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's overheated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.73,1:59:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这可不太妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops. This is not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.15,2:00:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别投降，大将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}No giben up, General Jar Jar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.48,2:00:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa think of something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.48,2:00:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来，我投降了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.99,2:00:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我投降了 我投降了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My give up. My give up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.58,2:00:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的小暴动该结束了，女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your little insurrection is at an end, Your Highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.84,2:00:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是该你签署协议的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for you to sign the treaty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.84,2:00:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,并结束国会里那些毫无意义的争论\N{\fnArial\fs30}and end this pointless debate in the senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.84,2:00:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viceroy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.72,2:00:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任职到期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your occupation here has ended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.22,2:00:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住她，这个女王是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}After her. This one's a decoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.19,2:01:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.91,2:01:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jam the doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.42,2:01:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督，我们现在该签署一个新协议了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Viceroy, we will discuss a new treaty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.49,2:02:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！有能源了，启动防护罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! We have power. Shields up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.29,2:02:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝尝这个！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.34,2:02:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这个！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.30,2:02:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 我们正在失去能源\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oops. - We're losing power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.18,2:02:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,主反应堆好像有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There seems to be a problem with the main reactor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.14,2:02:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.64,2:02:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的防护罩是坚不可摧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing can get through our shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.81,2:02:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们赶快离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.66,2:03:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？ 好像是里边爆炸了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that? It's blowing up from the inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.33,2:03:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我们打中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't hit it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.00,2:03:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这比赛艇还要过瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is Podracing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.67,2:03:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看，一艘我们的飞艇，在主货舱外面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, one of ours, out of the main hold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.78,2:03:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.37,2:03:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was'n they doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.70,2:03:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的指挥舰被炸毁了 看！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The control ship has been destroyed. Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.00,2:03:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all broke-ed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.77,2:04:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，已经太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:41.27,2:04:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 欧比旺\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Obi-Wan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.86,2:04:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.86,2:04:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我训练这个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me you will train the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.53,2:04:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.16,2:04:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是被选中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the chosen one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:57.87,2:05:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会带来平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will bring balance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.30,2:05:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Train him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.25,2:05:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督先生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Viceroy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.16,2:05:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你该回去向国会去解释这一切了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're going to have to go back to the senate and explain all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.34,2:05:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你也该和你的贸易特权说再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you can kiss your trade franchise goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.36,2:05:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好徒弟，欧比旺\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been a good apprentice, Obi-Wan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.03,2:06:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你，小天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, young Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.70,2:06:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的技艺和勇气令人折服\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will watch your career with great interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.54,2:06:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝贺你当选为共和国首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations on your election, Chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.21,2:06:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你救了我们的人民，女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boldness has saved our people, Your Majesty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.76,2:06:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该向你表示祝贺\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you who should be congratulated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.26,2:06:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们携手为共和国带来和平与繁荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together we shall bring peace and prosperity to the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:29.23,2:06:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要长老院授予你绝地武士称号这不成问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confer on you the level of Jedi knight the council does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:33.77,2:06:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你要我同意你收那个孩子做徒弟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But agree with your taking this boy as your Padawan learner…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.61,2:06:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个绝对不成\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.62,2:06:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是奎刚看中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Qui-Gon believed in him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.62,2:06:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也许是大预言中所说的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chosen one the boy may be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:48.42,2:06:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nevertheless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:50.17,2:06:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是训练他我认为是很危险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}grave danger I fear in his training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.17,2:06:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤达大师，我向奎刚保证过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Yoda, I gave Qui-Gon my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.43,2:06:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要训练安纳金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will train Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.60,2:07:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管长老院同意还是不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the approval of the council, if I must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.06,2:07:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你师父奎刚一样固执\N{\fnArial\fs30}Qui-Gon's defiance I sense in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.65,2:07:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need that you do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.82,2:07:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,长老院同意你的请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agree with you the council does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.20,2:07:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者是你的徒弟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your apprentice Skywalker will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.32,2:07:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这是要干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will happen to me now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.19,2:07:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,长老院已经同意我训练你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The council have granted me permission to train you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.36,2:07:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会成为一名绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be a Jedi, I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.21,2:08:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问，神秘武士是个西斯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no doubt the mysterious warrior was a Sith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.71,2:08:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们总是有两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always two there are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.30,2:08:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不多，也不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more, no less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.64,2:08:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个师父和一个徒弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}A master and an apprentice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.68,2:08:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是被毁掉的是谁呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But which was destroyed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.35,2:08:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父还是徒弟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The master or the apprentice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.57,2:08:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好，各位！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, everybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:35.29,2:09:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,和平！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.33,2:09:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ya-hoo!{\r}
